---
description: Blue Ocean Creatives website development rules
alwaysApply: true
---

# Project

Blue Ocean Creatives corporate website.

# Stack

- Astro
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS
- React only when browser state or interactivity is required

# Source of Truth

docs/BOC_Website_Plan_2026.md

Do not invent:

- statistics
- clients
- testimonials
- project results
- locations
- services
- company details

# Type

The primary typeface is Lexend, self-hosted. Do not switch the site back to Poppins.

# UI

Use:

- clean whitespace
- large headings
- navy and blue brand palette
- rounded cards
- real photography
- real system screenshots

Avoid:

- generic templates
- excessive gradients
- glassmorphism
- heavy animations
- fake statistics
- generic stock photos

# Components

Prefer Astro components.

Use React only when necessary.

# Responsive

Everything must work at 360px.

No horizontal overflow.

# Performance

Optimize images.
Lazy-load below-the-fold assets.
Minimize JavaScript.

# SEO

Use approved page titles and descriptions from the website plan.

# Code quality

Keep components reusable.
Avoid large monolithic pages.
Do not duplicate business data.
